{"id":"a0c9fd4a9724866d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure.md","title":"ZFC Prob Lp Space Measure","display":"df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure — ZFC Prob Lp Space Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure — ZFC Prob Lp Space Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-lp-space-measure — ZFC Prob Lp Space Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p,\\mu,X,\\Sigma,p,f,g,\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma},E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\in V\">\\(L^p,\\mu,X,\\Sigma,p,f,g,\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma},E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span>, and the integral are supplied by the displayed dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}\\)</span> (real-valued measurable-function set defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\">\\(E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\)</span> (almost-everywhere equality relation defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbLpSpaceMeasure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbLpSpaceMeasure}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}functions} \\vdash \\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^X:\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}functions} \\vdash \\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb R^X:\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X,\\Sigma)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure\\text{-}ae\\text{-}equality} \\vdash E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}^2:\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure\\text{-}ae\\text{-}equality} \\vdash E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle f,g\\rangle\\in\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}^2:\\mu(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq g(x)\\})=0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbLpSpaceMeasure}_S(L^p,\\mu,X,\\Sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land p\\in\\mathbb R\\land1\\leq p&lt;\\infty\\land L^p=\\{f\\in\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}:\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\}/E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}lp\\text{-}space\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbLpSpaceMeasure}_S(L^p,\\mu,X,\\Sigma,p)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mu(X)=1\\land p\\in\\mathbb R\\land1\\leq p&lt;\\infty\\land L^p=\\{f\\in\\mathcal M_{X,\\Sigma}:\\int_X|f|^p\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\}/E_{X,\\Sigma,\\mu}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The measurable-function carrier and the set-coded almost-everywhere equivalence relation are explicit; the measure is never applied to a disagreement set of arbitrary nonmeasurable functions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-integral","status":"resolved","id":"4884f45058a56aac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-integral]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","an